{%- style -%}
  .fm-guide-page {
    background-color: var(--fm-ivory);
    padding: clamp(50px, 8vw, 90px) 0;
  }
  .fm-guide-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px auto;
  }
  .fm-guide-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--fm-font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    color: var(--fm-forest);
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }
  .fm-guide-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--fm-border);
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .fm-guide-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--fm-font-serif);
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    color: var(--fm-forest);
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
  }
  .fm-guide-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--fm-font-serif);
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    color: var(--fm-forest);
    margin: 24px 0 12px 0;
  }
  .fm-guide-benefit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .fm-guide-benefit-item {
    background: var(--fm-ivory-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--fm-border-light);
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--fm-gold);
  }
  .fm-guide-benefit-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--fm-forest);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="fm-guide-page">
  <div class="fm-container-narrow">
    <div class="fm-guide-header">
      <span class="fm-value-tagline">PROTECTION & COMFORT</span>
      <h1>Anti-Slip Guide</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: #55524E; line-height: 1.7;">Underneath it all: what anti-slip rug pads do, why they matter, and how to choose the right one for your floors.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro Card -->
    <div class="fm-guide-card">
      <h2>Underneath It All: What Are Anti-Slip Mats?</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #55524E;">
        Anti-slip mats may not be the most thrilling topic, but don't underestimate their importance. They offer a wide range of benefits, from extending the life of your rugs to providing extra cushioning and preventing slips and falls.
      </p>

      <h3>Why Do You Need Anti-Slip Mats?</h3>
      <div class="fm-guide-benefit-grid">
        <div class="fm-guide-benefit-item">
          <div class="fm-guide-benefit-title">Floor Protection</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #666;">Prevents scratches, scuffs, and dye transfer on delicate hardwood or tile.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-guide-benefit-item">
          <div class="fm-guide-benefit-title">Slip Resistance</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #666;">Anchors the rug securely in place, eliminating bunched fabric and trip hazards.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-guide-benefit-item">
          <div class="fm-guide-benefit-title">Impact Absorption</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #666;">Absorbs foot traffic shock, shielding the rug pile from crushing.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-guide-benefit-item">
          <div class="fm-guide-benefit-title">Prolonged Lifespan</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #666;">Prevents friction against hard surfaces, increasing rug longevity by years.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-guide-benefit-item">
          <div class="fm-guide-benefit-title">Noise Reduction</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #666;">Dampens acoustic echo and footsteps in spacious modern rooms.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-guide-benefit-item">
          <div class="fm-guide-benefit-title">Comfort Underfoot</div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #666;">Adds a subtle, luxurious layer of responsive cushioning.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Custom Anti-slip Mat -->
    <div class="fm-guide-card">
      <h2>Custom Anti-slip Mat Tailored Just for You</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #55524E;">
        Indulge in unparalleled comfort and style with our custom rug pads, tailor-made to elevate your rug experience. At Farsh Mahal, we understand that your rug is more than just a decor piece but an investment. That's why we offer a unique opportunity to customize your rug pad with us, ensuring a perfect fit that complements your rug's individual dimensions.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #55524E;">
        Experience the difference as your rug stays in place, preventing slips and preserving the beauty of your floors. Embrace the tailored experience and customize your anti-slip mats with us — because when it comes to a rug, one size definitely doesn't fit all!
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQs on Rug Pads -->
    <div class="fm-guide-card">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions on Rug Pads</h2>
      
      <div class="fm-faq-item">
        <div class="fm-faq-q">
          <span>What are rug pads used for?</span>
          <span class="fm-faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-faq-a">
          Rug pads serve multiple purposes; they prevent your rugs from slipping and protect your floors from scratches, while providing extra cushioning and promoting air circulation to prevent moisture buildup. Plus, they make cleaning a breeze by acting as a barrier between the rug and the floor.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-faq-item">
        <div class="fm-faq-q">
          <span>What size rug pad do I need?</span>
          <span class="fm-faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-faq-a">
          Choose a rug pad that matches your rug's size and shape. Opt for an exact fit or slightly larger pad that can be trimmed. Non-slip pads should be approximately 1 inch smaller than the rug on all sides to remain concealed.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-faq-item">
        <div class="fm-faq-q">
          <span>Does the rug pad stick to the floor?</span>
          <span class="fm-faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-faq-a">
          No, a rug pad doesn't stick with adhesive. Non-slip or gripper rug pads prevent rugs from slipping and sliding through micro-friction and can be easily lifted and removed anytime as they are simply placed beneath the rug.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-faq-item">
        <div class="fm-faq-q">
          <span>Can you stitch my rug pad to my carpet?</span>
          <span class="fm-faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-faq-a">
          It's not recommended to stitch a rug pad to your carpet as it may cause damage to the foundation backing and make it difficult to clean, rotate, or rearrange the rug in the future.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-faq-item">
        <div class="fm-faq-q">
          <span>How do I clean rug pads?</span>
          <span class="fm-faq-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-faq-a">
          To clean a rug pad, vacuum both sides regularly on low power. Washable pads can be machine washed on a gentle cycle with mild detergent and air-dried. Non-washable pads can be spot-cleaned with a damp cloth or hand-rinsed.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    const items = document.querySelectorAll('.fm-guide-page .fm-faq-item');
    items.forEach(item => {
      const q = item.querySelector('.fm-faq-q');
      q.addEventListener('click', () => {
        item.classList.toggle('open');
      });
    });
  });
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FM Anti-Slip Guide",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-fm-anti-slip",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FM Anti-Slip Guide"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
